{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/FastAPI Device-Aware Network Service.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/FastAPI Device-Aware Network Service.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"fast api device aware network service fast api device aware network service","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/FastAPI Device-Aware Network Service.md","fileName":"FastAPI Device-Aware Network Service.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"FastAPI Device-Aware Network Service","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 18:30\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Network AI Application Architecture]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Network AI Application Architecture","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/FastAPI Device-Aware Network Service.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/FastAPI Device-Aware Network Service.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"fast api device aware network service fast api device aware network service","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/FastAPI Device-Aware Network Service.md","fileName":"FastAPI Device-Aware Network Service.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"FastAPI Device-Aware Network Service","heading":"FastAPI Device-Aware Network Service","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A FastAPI device-aware network service exposes a typed endpoint whose request contains both a question and a device family. The backend uses that context to ask for Cisco IOS, Junos, Arista, or generic guidance instead of treating every platform as interchangeable.\n\nPydantic-style request models make required fields explicit, and exception handling can return a controlled error instead of leaking internals. Device context improves relevance but must be validated against inventory; a client-provided label is not authoritative. The API response should remain advisory unless a separate, authenticated workflow approves action.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Network AI Application Architecture","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/FastAPI Device-Aware Network Service.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/FastAPI Device-Aware Network Service.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"fast api device aware network service fast api device aware network service","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/FastAPI Device-Aware Network Service.md","fileName":"FastAPI Device-Aware Network Service.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"FastAPI Device-Aware Network Service","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[ainetworkingcookbook.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Network AI Application Architecture","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}